   |                      ^^^
  = hint: `row` is a copy of each element; to change the elements of `grid`, loop over indexes and write `grid[i2]` instead of `row`: for i2 in 0..len(grid) { }

error[E0205]: cannot assign to `s`, it is immutable
  --> tests/errors/E0205_loop_element.al:20:9
